    "title_en": "On Estimating Quantum Divergences with $p$-Power Means",
    "abstract_en": "We study the problem of estimating the quantum divergence with $p$-power means, $Φ_p(ρ\\,\\|\\,σ)$. This quantity was investigated by Lam and Le (\\textit{Linear Algebra Appl.} 2021). For any constant $p \\in (0, 1)$, we present sample-efficient and query-efficient quantum algorithms for estimating $Φ_p(ρ\\,\\|\\,σ)$ and further show that estimating $Φ_p(ρ\\,\\|\\,σ)$ is $\\mathsf{BQP}$-complete in the low-rank case.",
